  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "平均力的冲量的表示式为 $\\overline F\\Delta t=mnS\\overline{v_x^2}\\Delta t$。因为 $\\overline{v_x^2}=↵\\frac{1}{3}\\overline{v^2}$，所以，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\overline F\\Delta t=\\frac{1}{3}mnSv^2\\Delta t.$　$(3-9)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "消去方程 $(3-9)$ 中的 $\\Delta t$，并被 $S$ 除，则得气体的压强"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$p=\\frac{1}{3}mn\\overline{v^2}.$　$(3-10)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是气体分子运动论的基本方程。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**理想气体的压强与分子的质量、单位体积内的分子数和**",
        "**分子运动的均方速度的乘积成正比。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "公式 $(3-10)$ 把宏观量——可以用压强计测量的压强，与",
        "表征分子的微观量联系了起来，好象是两个世界——宏观世",
        "界和微观世界之间的桥梁。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "推导气体分子运动论的基本方程时没有明确地考虑分子",
        "间的碰撞。但是，这并不是说没有考虑碰撞。正是大量的碰",
        "撞才导致分子的运动是紊乱的。恰恰是由于大量的碰撞，等",
        "式 $(3-4)$ 和 $(3-5)$ 才相当精确。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果用 $\\overline E$ 表示分子的平均平动动能 $\\overline E=\\frac{m\\overline{v^2}}{2}$，则方程 $(3-↵10)$ 可写成"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$p=\\frac{2}{3}n\\overline E.$　$(3-11)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "33. 温度——分子平均动能的量度"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据气体分子运动论的基本方程，可以得出一个很重要",
        "的推论：温度是分子平均动能的量度。现在证明之。"
      ]
    },
